<%- include('partials/header') %>

<main>
    <h1>About Emberhold</h1>

    <section class="card">
        <h2>The Guild Hall Awaits</h2>
        <p>
            Emberhold Quest Portal is a medieval adventure reservation system
            where guild members can discover quests, reserve experiences, and
            track their journey from request to completion.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="card">
        <h2>Built for Adventurers</h2>
        <p>
            Travelers can browse quests, join the guild, request reservations,
            and eventually share reviews of the adventures they complete.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="card">
        <h2>Managed by the Guild</h2>
        <p>
            Staff and guild masters can manage quests, update reservation
            statuses, review submissions, and keep the realm organized.
        </p>
    </section>
</main>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>